<title>USA: Total World sees profit as early as Q1.</title>
<headline>Total World sees profit as early as Q1.</headline>
<dateline>BOCA RATON, Fla. 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Total World Telecommunications Inc said Wednesday it expects to exceed its projections of $106 million in revenues and $0.90 earnings per share for the fiscal year ending September 30, 1997.</p>
<p>The company said it would be profitable as early as the fiscal first quarter ended December 31.</p>
